"T3DWindowTitle" "Personal Log - James Henson, Surface Exploration Team."
"T3DMessageText" "14th June 2182"
"T3DMessageText2" "What the hell is going on here?  I get back from a routine sector survey and this place has gone to shit!?  Where is everyone?"
"T3DMessageText3" "The computer reports lifesigns in subprocessing and I think I heard some noises down there, guess I'll have to go see what's going down.  Jimmy out."
