"T3DWindowTitle" "Colony Status Report"
"T3DMessageText" "Cargo bay - condition orange, power failure detected.  Recommend repair team.  South airlock - functioning within acceptable limits.  Main access corridors - unknown lifeforms detected, recommend security and hazmat team.  Central command - warning, absence of command staff detected, violation of colony command protocol 15363.  Forward observation - atmospheric intrustion detected, recommend sealing of facility until repairs can be made."
"T3DMessageText2" "Subprocessing access way - condition orange, venting high temperature gases due to failure in parent system.  Subprocessing access vents - condition red, major infestation of unknown biological material.  Recommend security team seal off area and contact IAF immediately.  Databank area 1 - condition red, massive infestation of alien lifeforms causing ruptured cooling systems, data lines and power conduits.  Colony condition critical."
"T3DMessageText3" "Automated distress signal active, the Interstellar Armed Forces have been notified of present conditions."
