"T3DWindowTitle" "Subject: Solar phenomena"
"T3DMessageText" "29th May 2182"
"T3DMessageText2" "Hey James, did you notice how dark it was yesterday afternoon?  Our long range telescopes picked up something interesting.  We thought at first it might be a partial solar eclipse from one of the orbiting moons."
"T3DMessageText3" "After a closer look, it seems like something big was moving past the line of sight to our star.  We're not sure what.  We sent a message back to the company, maybe they'll send a survey ship to check it out."
"T3DMessageText4" "I know, I know, they won't lift a finger, but it doesn't hurt to try.  -Pete"
"T3DButtonOutputStatus" "NO_SOURCE_EVENT"
